   "subject": "collaboration between a Linux user and a Windows user",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hello, <div><br></div><div>I&#39;m using Linux and I&#39;m collaborating with a Windows user (using Git). </div><div><br></div><div>We have done a first attempt to use packrat. I am the initiator. My <b>packrat.lock</b> file contains :</div><div><br></div><blockquote style=\"margin:0 0 0 40px;border:none;padding:0px\"><div><div><i>Repos: CRAN=<a href=\"http://cran.rstudio.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://cran.rstudio.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793242674086000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3ozHEYbjP7Yw228jM0xJie\">http://cran.rstudio.com</a>,</i></div></div><div><div><i>    BioCsoft=<a href=\"http://bioconductor.org/packages/2.14/bioc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://bioconductor.org/packages/2.14/bioc&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793242674086000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2FwAnD3kVaysDvGUI2hQcB\">http://bioconductor.org/packages/2.14/bioc</a>,</i></div></div><div><div><i>    BioCann=<a href=\"http://bioconductor.org/packages/2.14/data/annotation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://bioconductor.org/packages/2.14/data/annotation&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793242674086000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0mZYmlHWhZsHPiU9aPGLOA\">http://bioconductor.org/packages/2.14/data/annotation</a>,</i></div></div><div><div><i>    BioCexp=<a href=\"http://bioconductor.org/packages/2.14/data/experiment\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://bioconductor.org/packages/2.14/data/experiment&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793242674086000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3AljhX4tGokZjt--Ou9VFw\">http://bioconductor.org/packages/2.14/data/experiment</a>,</i></div></div><div><div><i>    BioCextra=<a href=\"http://bioconductor.org/packages/2.14/extra\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://bioconductor.org/packages/2.14/extra&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793242674086000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1gLMcPaxTQoOXGwomlaRl2\">http://bioconductor.org/packages/2.14/extra</a></i></div></div></blockquote><div><br></div><div>and when the Windows user has run <b>packrat::init()</b> he get the following warnings :</div><div><br></div><blockquote style=\"margin:0 0 0 40px;border:none;padding:0px\"><div><div><i>Warning: unable to access index for repository <a href=\"http://bioconductor.org/packages/2.14/bioc/bin/windows/contrib/3.0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://bioconductor.org/packages/2.14/bioc/bin/windows/contrib/3.0&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793242674086000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2KmoVspXdReaBOAB7kMsFY\">http://bioconductor.org/packages/2.14/bioc/bin/windows/contrib/3.0</a></i></div></div><div><div><i>Warning: unable to access index for repository <a href=\"http://bioconductor.org/packages/2.14/data/annotation/bin/windows/contrib/3.0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://bioconductor.org/packages/2.14/data/annotation/bin/windows/contrib/3.0&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793242674086000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0kg3mzuLMmnGssg4EiZJz8\">http://bioconductor.org/packages/2.14/data/annotation/bin/windows/contrib/3.0</a></i></div></div><div><div><i>Warning: unable to access index for repository <a href=\"http://bioconductor.org/packages/2.14/data/experiment/bin/windows/contrib/3.0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://bioconductor.org/packages/2.14/data/experiment/bin/windows/contrib/3.0&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793242674086000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2t8pboVQDRtyDLaxT9SW-3\">http://bioconductor.org/packages/2.14/data/experiment/bin/windows/contrib/3.0</a></i></div></div><div><div><i>Warning: unable to access index for repository <a href=\"http://bioconductor.org/packages/2.14/extra/bin/windows/contrib/3.0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://bioconductor.org/packages/2.14/extra/bin/windows/contrib/3.0&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793242674086000&amp;usg=AOvVaw29MbRufBnE3TG4mdTKpTgL\">http://bioconductor.org/packages/2.14/extra/bin/windows/contrib/3.0</a></i></div></div></blockquote><div><br></div><div>Should we add some repositories for the Windows user ? </div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "xNNBaAaDSyoJ",
