bin/windows/contrib/3.0</a></i></div></div><div><div><i>Warning: unable to access index for repository <a href=\"http://bioconductor.org/packages/2.14/extra/bin/windows/contrib/3.0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://bioconductor.org/packages/2.14/extra/bin/windows/contrib/3.0&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793242674088000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1lfj6H7jFGjm0Szf6SCwJg\">http://bioconductor.org/packages/2.14/extra/bin/windows/contrib/3.0</a></i></div></div></blockquote><div><br></div><div>Should we add some repositories for the Windows user ? </div><span><font color=\"#888888\"><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div></font></span></div></blockquote></div></div>"
