   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hello Kevin, <div><br></div><div> I think the packrat.lock file should be splitted into two files, as below. The first part is user-specific : a difference between Packrat version, R version, links to repos, is not extremely important for collaborating.  The second part containing the packages versions is extremely important for collaboration.</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#606\">PackratFormat</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1.4</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">PackratVersion</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.4</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1.1</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">RVersion</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">3.1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span></div></code></div></div></div>"
    ],
