    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div><br></div><br>Le mercredi 14 janvier 2015 20:11:16 UTC+1, Kevin Ushey a écrit :<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Stéphane,<div><br></div><div>The issue here appears to be incompatible BioC versions. Notice the paths generated:</div><div><br></div><div>    <i style=\"font-size:13px\"><a href=\"http://bioconductor.org/packages/2.14/bioc/bin/windows/contrib/3.0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://bioconductor.org/packages/2.14/bioc/bin/windows/contrib/3.0&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793242674095000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1oPbx09FgXHDwYaQ3h0k71\">http://bioconductor.org/packages/2.14/bioc/bin/windows/contrib/3.0</a></i></div><div><br></div><div>The base comes from Packrat, and has 2.14, but is completed with 3.0. I imagine this is because we are seeing an incorrect version of BiocInstaller on the path?</div><div><br></div><div>I think a fix would involve us manually constructing these URLs, I think, and only respecting what we see in the Packrat lockfile -- but let me know if you can think of a local workaround as well.</div><div><br></div><div>Thanks,</div><div>Kevin</div></div><div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Wed, Jan 14, 2015 at 1:37 AM, &#39;Stéphane Laurent&#39; via packrat-discuss <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a rel=\"nofollow\">packrat...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hello, <div><br></div><div>I&#39;m using Linux and I&#39;m collaborating with a Windows user (using Git). </div><div><br></div><div>We have done a first attempt to use packrat. I am the initiator. My <b>packrat.lock</b> file contains :</div><div><br></div><blockquote style=\"margin:0 0 0 40px;border:none;padding:0px\"><div><div><i>Repos: CRAN=<a href=\"http://cran.rstudio.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://cran.rstudio.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793242674095000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0eHGu3ncOxRhfa-OXjzvya\">http://cran.rstudio.com</a>,</i></div></div><div><div><i>    BioCsoft=<a href=\"http://bioconductor.org/packages/2.14/bioc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://bioconductor.org/packages/2.14/bioc&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793242674095000&amp;usg=AOvVaw05g2sM2D2wd7rtm5cK7-1I\">http://bioconductor.org/packages/2.14/bioc</a>,</i></div></div><div><div><i>    BioCann=<a href=\"http://bioconductor.org/packages/2.14/data/annotation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://bioconductor.org/packages/2.14/data/annotation&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793242674095000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1seGDT3RmACNnppHVSDw5V\">http://bioconductor.org/packages/2.14/data/annotation</a>,</i></div></div><div><div><i>    BioCexp=<a href=\"http://bioconductor.org/packages/2.14/data/experiment\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://bioconductor.org/packages/2.14/data/experiment&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793242674095000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3dN2cmKMPyjvqXTefKOLhj\">http://bioconductor.org/packages/2.14/data/experiment</a>,</i></div></div><div><div><i>    BioCextra=<a href=\"http://bioconductor.org/packages/2.14/extra\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://bioconductor.org/packages/2.14/extra&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793242674095000&amp;usg=AOvVaw31irDky_0ZvXwcInVXTsHt\">http://bioconductor.org/packages/2.14/extra</a></i></div></div></blockquote><div><br></div><div>and when the Windows user has run <b>packrat::init()</b> he get the following warnings :</div><div><br></div><blockquote style=\"margin:0 0 0 40px;border:none;padding:0px\"><div><div><i>Warning: unable to access index for repository <a href=\"http://bioconductor.org/packages/2.14/bioc/bin/windows/contrib/3.0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://bioconductor.org/packages/2.14/bioc/bin/windows/contrib/3.0&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793242674095000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1oPbx09FgXHDwYaQ3h0k71\">http://bioconductor.org/packages/2.14/bioc/bin/windows/contrib/3.0</a></i></div></div><div><div><i>Warning: unable to access index for repository <a href=\"http://bioconductor.org/packages/2.14/data/annotation/bin/windows/contrib/3.0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://bioconductor.org/packages/2.14/data/annotation/bin/windows/contrib/3.0&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793242674095000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1s2HXlGrzy9w4j0zih_dZQ\">http://bioconductor.org/packages/2.14/data/annotation/bin/windows/contrib/3.0</a></i></div></div><div><div><i>Warning: unable to access index for repository <a href=\"http://bioconductor.org/packages/2.14/data/experiment/bin/windows/contrib/3.0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://bioconductor.org/packages/2.14/data/experiment/bin/windows/contrib/3.0&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793242674095000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3bniJkHr-O746Aka5J5YGS\">http://bioconductor.org/packages/2.14/data/experiment/bin/windows/contrib/3.0</a></i></div></div><div><div><i>Warning: unable to access index for repository <a href=\"http://bioconductor.org/packages/2.14/extra/bin/windows/contrib/3.0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://bioconductor.org/packages/2.14/extra/bin/windows/contrib/3.0&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793242674095000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1vciMJteIxpvVR8lkMYKSP\">http://bioconductor.org/packages/2.14/extra/bin/windows/contrib/3.0</a></i></div></div></blockquote><div><br></div><div>Should we add some repositories for the Windows user ? </div><span><font color=\"#888888\"><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div></font></span></div><span><font color=\"#888888\">\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;packrat-discuss&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a rel=\"nofollow\">packrat-discu...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nFor more options, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/optout\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/optout&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793242674095000&amp;usg=AOvVaw104ZOgemkNqzQgNJhMuFh-\">https://groups.google.com/d/optout</a>.<br>\r\n</font></span></blockquote></div><br></div>\r\n</blockquote></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
